# Butler Routes - Redridge Mountains completionist (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Every Redridge accept in the local census (44 quests,
# docs/redridge-census.md) appears exactly once as an accept and once as a
# turnin — except 93551 Praise, an accept-only record with no turn-in in the
# data (Ironforge 95924/95925 precedent: contracted with an honest note,
# never an invented turn-in). No race header: the data shows no race-locked
# quests here, so per-line class gates only (Warrior, Rogue). Soft-pre
# accepts whose blocking pre-quest sits outside the contract carry a note at
# the accept; their completes and turn-ins stand alone in `when onquest`
# mini-steps. Coordinates in Redridge use the live frame; expedition stops
# use the frames their data carries, set with zone map lines.
guide butler-routes-completionist/redridge-mountains
title Redridge Mountains - Completionist
levels 14-26
zone Redridge Mountains
faction Alliance
category Leveling
folder Completionist
keywords redridge, completionist
coords live
version 1

step West road — Parker and the gnolls

  note In from Elwynn along the west road: Guard Parker holds the gnoll line, and Tamelyn Aldridge's license starts the oddest errand in the zone. Quests here run 14 to 26 — the steps say which legs belong where; the three level-58-plus records carry their own notes.
  accept 244 -- Encroaching Gnolls - Guard Parker; Deputy Feldon takes it, south
  turnin 244 -- Encroaching Gnolls - Parker's word to Deputy Feldon
  accept 246 -- Assessing the Threat - Deputy Feldon; Redridge Mongrels and Poachers
  complete 246 @9.42,65.82 era -- Redridge Mongrels for Deputy Feldon, west
  complete 246 @23.25,79.41 era -- Redridge Poachers for Deputy Feldon, south-east
  turnin 246 -- Assessing the Threat - back to Deputy Feldon
  goto 10.37,71.26
  accept 98407 -- Show of Force - Guard Parker; Spiked Collars off the Redridge Thrashers
  note 98407's pre (244 above) fills here — take 98407 after it.
  complete 98407 @8.51,67.77 era -- Spiked Collars off the Redridge Thrashers for Guard Parker
  turnin 98407 -- Show of Force - back to Guard Parker
  note Tamelyn Aldridge sells the Advertising License Application: buy it from her, then accept.
  buy 270888 "Advertising License Application"
  accept 95816 -- Sign Me Up! - Tamelyn Aldridge; Elaine Compton takes the forms, at 60
  complete 95816 @6.17,71.71 era -- the Massive Pile of Completed Forms for Elaine Compton; the pile has no placed source in the data, so have it in your bags
  turnin 95816 -- Sign Me Up! - the forms to Elaine Compton
  goto 9.71,70.86
  accept 98247 -- Shipping Label - Marcy Baker; back to Marcy Baker, at 60
  note 98247's starter (the Shipping Label) has no placed source in the data — have it in your bags. The Barrens twin (98248, Dokimi's label) stays out — Marcy's label is the contracted pick.
  turnin 98247 -- Shipping Label - back to Marcy Baker

